          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: મંચ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મંચ — manc — \"a stage\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "જો મંચ તૈયાર હશે તો નાટક સમયસર શરૂ થશે. jo manc taiyār haśe to nāṭak samaysar śarū thaśe. If the stage is ready, the play will start on time."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A masculine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મંચ (manc) is a tatsama, taken from Sanskrit mañca, \"a raised platform, a stage\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
