              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ગજાવવું (gajāvvũ) is built from ગાજવું, \"to thunder\", with the causative -āv- and a shortened vowel: to make a place thunder. CDIAL files ગાજવું under Sanskrit garjati, \"roars\" (CDIAL 4046)."
            }
          ]
        },
